k \u2022 Sabah until 5:00 PM; Friday, 13 November 2026. This condition may cause strong winds up to 50 kmph and rough seas with wave height up to 3.5 metres and is dangerous to small boats. SECTION B: FOR SHIPPING 1) WARNING ON STRONG WINDS AND ROUGH SEAS (SECOND CATEGORY) Strong northwesterly winds of 50 - 60 kmph with wave height up to 4.5 metres are expected over the waters of Western part of Phuket within the period of Monday, 16 November 2026 until Wednesday, 18 November 2026. This condition of strong winds and rough seas is dangerous to all shipping and coastal activities including fishing and ferry services. 2) WARNING ON STRONG WINDS AND ROUGH SEAS (FIRST CATEGORY) Strong northwesterly winds of 40 - 50 kmph with wave height up to 3.5 metres are expected over the waters of Northern Straits Of Melaka \u2022 Eastern part of Phuket within the period of Monday, 16 November 2026 until Wednesday, 18 November 2026. This condition of strong winds and rough seas is dangerous to small crafts, recreational sea activities and water sports. 3) THUNDERSTORMS WARNING Thunderstorms, heavy rain and strong winds are expected over the waters of Phuket \u2022 Samui \u2022 Tioman \u2022 Sulawesi \u2022 Straits Of Melaka \u2022 Reef South \u2022 Bunguran \u2022 Northern part of Condore \u2022 Reef North \u2022 Sulu \u2022 Palawan \u2022 Layang-Layang \u2022 Labuan until 5:00 PM; Friday, 13 November 2026. This condition may cause strong winds up to 50 kmph and rough seas with wave height up to 3.5 metres and is dangerous to small boats.","areas":["Labuan","Layang-Layang","Sulu","Sulawesi","Reef North","Reef South","Condore","Sabah","Sarawak","Kelantan","Terengganu","Pahang","Johor","Selangor","Melaka","Samui","Tioman","Phuket","Straits Of Melaka"],"subsections":[{"text":"1) THUNDERSTORMS WARNING Thunderstorms, heavy rain and strong winds are expected over the waters of Selangor \u2022 Johor \u2022 Pahang \u2022 Terengganu \u2022 Kelantan \u2022 Western Sarawak \u2022 Sabah until 5: